1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,320
Can one animated scene play in two languages?

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,370
This short test says every line twice, once in English and once in French.

3
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:20,930
The French voice keeps its own pace, so the French video gets its own timeline.

4
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:26,880
The scene is keyed to the lines, so it follows either timing without a change.

5
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:35,850
Here, 1,250,000 is written the way each language writes it.

6
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:40,450
And every label on screen is swapped for its French.
